== 7. Next ===================================================== 
  Script 27 is now a VALIDATION, not the source of labels: our 
  independent K=15 fit can be cross-tabulated against their 
  MaxTopicsName. Agreement is evidence the reproduction was 
  faithful; disagreement is worth knowing and would have been 
  invisible without this file. 
 
  Script 28 uses THEIR labels. The readout becomes 'RASSF9 in the 
  nevus and melanoma compartments as defined by the authors of the 
  dataset', which is a materially stronger claim than one resting 
  on our own classifier, and it retires the limitation that the 
  labels were our reproduction. 
  no warnings raised 
